# Pass "sans-facultatifs": the minimal set plus the shared Def-field step (PickleTools/DefFieldSteps), which
# Pickle's own def steps cannot replace: Sloth names a ThingDef and a PawnKindDef, and the biome and recipe
# reads are not built in. Select it with -DepMap wsl-deps.sans-facultatifs.map; no optional gameplay mod here.
nelim.pickletools.deffields   path:PickleTools/DefFieldSteps/Mod
